# Agent scratch. Probe scripts written to poke at a running server during a bug hunt or a
# render check — throwaway by nature, and often belonging to a session other than yours, so
# never commit or delete them. Tracked code never matches these (checked): _design/ is a
# directory, and no tracked file is a root-level _*.mjs / _*.cjs.
_*.mjs
_*.cjs
*.tgz

# Security findings. This repo is PUBLIC. These describe unfixed holes in a live app in enough
# detail to exploit them — publishing that before the fixes ship hands an attacker a map.
# Keep them local; delete them once the findings they describe are closed.
*FINDINGS*.md
*findings*.md
_bughunt*.md
CLICKABLE_AUDIT.md
